nt of Conditional Linear Dependence and Feedback Between Time Series</article-title><source>Journal of the American Statistical Association</source><year>1982</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>907</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2307/2288723</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Geweke</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Measurement of Linear Dependence and Feedback Between Multiple Time Series</article-title><source>Journal of the American Statistical Association</source><year>1982</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>304</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2307/2287238</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>FV</given-names></name></person-group><source>An introduction to Bayesian networks</source><year>1996</year><publisher-name>London: UCL Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bach</surname><given-names>FR</given-names></name><name><surname>Jordan</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Learning Graphical Models for Stationary Time Series</article-title><source>IEEE transactions on signal processing</source><year>2004</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>2189</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1109/TSP.2004.831032</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Buntine</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Operations for Learning with Graphical Models</article-title><source>Journal of Artificial Intelligence Research</source><year>1994</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>159</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="aut